<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.080
We've now found all the Chaos Emeralds.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.750
We finally did it.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.170
By the way, what's that?

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.630
That's...

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.720
That looks incredible. What is it?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.440
Planet Eggs are the life sources of planets.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:14.570
They're using the power of the Chaos Emeralds to evolve them into highly concentrated crystals.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.610
Why?

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.070
Do you want to know?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.840
Long time no see, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:42.030
Episode 64

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:42.030
Clash! Sonic VS Shadow

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.690
My name is Dark Oak, ruler of the Metarex.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.240
You know him?

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.570
We fought before.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.210
I'm not letting my guard down this time!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:22.640
I'm also fully prepared, Ruler of Light!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:30.140
I've collected data on all your battles up to now.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.060
I've inputted the data into them.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.610
Why are you doing this?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:40.110
You killed my people and destroyed many planets!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.530
What are you going to do with the Planet Eggs that you collected?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.790
Kill them.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.750
Sonic!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.270
I said that I wouldn't let my guard down!

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.570
He vanished??

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.360
It's a hologram.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.660
Sonic, here they come!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:34.500
This fortress will be your graveyard.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.800
Eggman, I'll never forgive you!

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.890
Calm down, Knuckles.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.730
Let's discuss this.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.350
I'm against violence!

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.820
We have to do something about this ship first!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.860
If we fall, it's big trouble!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.530
What's going on?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.080
This is Typhoon! It's an emergency!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.330
Tails, what's happening?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.170
An unidentified armada is coming from south of the fortress! It's a fleet of Metarex ships!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.840
Enemy ships are also coming from the north!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.760
Also from the east! And the west!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.890
We're surrounded!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.890
A Metarex armada?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.060
What's going on?

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.480
Shadow, circumstances have changed.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.770
Escape from the fortress immediately.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:42.440
Doctor, explain. Do you see what we're seeing?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:47.450
Yeah, I'm embarrassed that I fell for such a simple tactic.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.030
Can you hear me?

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:51.990
To those who disturb order!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.410
My name is Red Pine.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:03.210
I'm one of the four Metarex bosses that serve under Dark Oak.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.340
Four Metarex bosses?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:10.800
You're completely surrounded. Escape is impossible!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:18.230
Since you collected the Chaos Emeralds, you saved us the trouble of searching for them.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:22.610
You're fools for not trusting each other!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.440
You can't escape! You'll perish inside the fortress!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.950
You're all talk!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.570
Shadow, return to the ship immediately.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.120
We'll deal with the Chaos Emeralds some other time.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.080
Ready the engines and shields immediately!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.340
Okay!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.170
Hey, Eggman!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:49.680
You should also go back before it's too late!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.850
Eggman!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:01.980
Damn! I have to fly this all by myself?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.730
Roger. I'll return immediately.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.690
What about the Chaos Emeralds?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.740
Shadow!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.450
Help, Chris!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.780
Amy?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.870
It's Sonic!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.160
Sonic is going to lose!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.870
Sonic?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.220
How dare you do that to my Sonic!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.720
Take this!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.600
What are you doing?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.810
Let me go!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.520
Amy!

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.440
I'll show you!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.700
If I give this to Sonic...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.760
Does this ignite the engines?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.930
It doesn't!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.480
I'm bad with machines!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:30.740
The Metarex plant has ejected the Planet Egg!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:35.950
The Metarex plant is now assigned for destruction.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.580
Destroy the fortress, along with our enemies!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.580
All ships, fire!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.300
Raise the shields!

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.050
Roger! Raising the shields!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.510
Shields off!

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.060
Fire anti-ship missiles!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.570
Shields on!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.370
Tails, we can't survive much longer!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:24.330
They're going to destroy us, along with this fortress!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.250
Shadow! Do you really think you can escape by yourselves?

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.300
That's right! Even Sonic is having a tough battle!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.260
Doctor makes all the decisions.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:41.890
Why do you keep following Eggman's orders? Is it because he's the grandson of your creator?

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.140
My creator?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:48.060
No, Eggman is just using him.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.400
What do you mean by that?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.860
Do you really think that Eggman is going to give your memory back?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:58.030
Eggman may not have the key to your memories to begin with!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.030
Shadow, will you help us?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.370
Why should I?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:08.040
No reason. We just need your help.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:11.920
Shadow!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.420
We're going back using Chaos Control. Let's go!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.300
What are you doing?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.550
I was ordered not to leave you alone.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.550
I've had enough of you!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.760
Chaos Control!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.940
Took you long enough, Shadow.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.240
You brought along an extra.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.370
Why are you glaring at me?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.970
Chris?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.260
Why did he come along?

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.470
Is he joining our team?

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.430
Long time no see, Dr. Eggman.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:16.900
You always hung out with Sonic, but I never thought you would come to this world.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:20.200
Did you beg your grandpa to build you a teleporter?

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:25.660
I built the teleporter because six years have already passed in my world.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.410
So you're saying that you've matured.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.460
Then why are you so small?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.920
There are lots of reasons why!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:45.180
You seem concerned, but there's nothing you can do.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:52.190
I heard that before. That I relied too much on others and made them do my work.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.440
Really? I don't really remember.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.900
It's true that I'm weak and small.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:02.030
But I've decided to stand on my own two feet!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.250
You thief!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.920
That idiot! He's turned into a delinquent!

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.940
All right! It's starting up!

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.280
Here I come, Sonic!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.630
Cosmo!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.680
The Chaos Emeralds!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.310
I won't let you have them!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.320
What was that?

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:27.410
It came from outside the fortress.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.960
They're planning to destroy us, along with the fortress!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:41.250
What? But many of their comrades are in here!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.010
We're sacrificial pawns!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:49.300
We're ready to give up our lives in order to have a tranquil universe in the future!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.160
Rouge?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:03.880
After this mess is sorted out, will you let me have the Chaos Emeralds?

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.760
I don't know if I can do that.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.340
You're so stingy.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.420
I quit.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.260
Chris!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.850
Knuckles?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:34.780
Shield energy is down another 30%, Tails!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:41.250
20 to starboard! We'll use the asteroids ahead as shields while firing anti-laser torpedoes #2 through 5!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:45.630
If we're destroyed, the others will have no place to go!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.800
I have to survive, no matter what!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.420
Eggman, things look bad!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:54.350
Since we don't have the Chaos Emeralds, the shields won't last for long!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.560
What's taking Shadow so long?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:02.770
What's this? There's a powerful gravitational anomaly at the center of the fortress!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.990
Is it a distortion in space that connects to another dimension?

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.260
Sonic!

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:15.890
Impossible!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:23.560
There are two individuals who can draw out the power of the Chaos Emeralds?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:55.720
I see. How we look isn't our only similarity.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:04.230
You annoying hedgehog, give me the Chaos Emeralds!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.770
What are you going to do when you collect the Chaos Emeralds?

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:13.110
So you're just following orders again.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.240
You're no ultimate life form!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:29.580
That's the hero that draws out the power of the Chaos Emeralds.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.790
Sonic... Shadow...

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.990
Oh no!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.700
There's a gravitational field in the middle of the fortress?

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.530
Hurry up and get ready to retrieve Sonic!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.250
The gravitational field is expanding!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.670
Set engines at full speed!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.420
It's no good! We're not stopping!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.510
No way...

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.730
This can't be happening!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.660
Without the Chaos Emeralds, we'll run out of power!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.290
We're going to be sucked in!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.760
Eggman?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.060
Sonic!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.650
It's too late.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:49.490
Master Emerald, please lend us your power!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.880
Energy recharged!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.750
Engines full power!

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.630
Roger! Maximum speed!

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:25.610
I didn't expect that there would be two who could control the light.

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.750
They survived by using overwhelming power.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:37.420
That's fine.

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:42.300
Show me what more you have in store!

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:54.060
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:54.060
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:54.060
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:45.970 --> 00:22:48.970
<i>Original Concept Created by</i>

